// AUTO-GENERATED — tiny fallback fonts so server-side export (resvg) can draw
// the currency signs the hostels actually use. Our bundled brand faces are
// Latin subsets: none has the Thai baht (฿) or Khmer riel (៛), and Archivo
// Black / Titan One / the Girly faces also lack dong (₫), peso (₱) and kip (₭),
// so those signs exported as a box or vanished entirely while the browser
// preview quietly fell back to a system font. resvg falls back per glyph to any
// loaded font that has it; these three (Noto Sans, Noto Sans Thai, Noto Sans
// Khmer, instanced at the black weight and subset to the signs only, ~2KB
// each) are listed FIRST so heavy display text gets a heavy sign.
//   MM Currency Latin: ₫ ₱ ₭ ₹ ¥ ₩   MM Currency Thai: ฿   MM Currency Khmer: ៛
